orms to descend to the ground below.\n⚔️ Place towers to defend the village from waves of bugs!\n🎉 Buy crates from the traveling salesman to unlock new cards, new defenders.\n\n🪙 Premium players get double cash while in the Inner Ship AFK room!\n🤝 Join the Stud TD community server for codes and announcements!\n\nSince this game is currently in alpha, please report any bugs (or suggestions) to our community server. We would really appreciate your help!\n\nKeybinds:\nR: Upgrade\nF: Switch Targeting\nV: Sell\nT: Toggle Increased Game Speed\n1-9: Place Tower\n\nMade by Vansmena and ChickenGOD4","path":"/game/126273633980561-stud-tower-defense","slug":"126273633980561-stud-tower-defense","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ca4cd50ffc38b3234fe89f220f6567ea201593bfe853102e4c514216c3621738.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f8849004db15b91a26231eaefb331e5e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":19723739,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-26T06:11:46.576Z","creator":{"name":"Otis Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":123997758440605,"name":"Boys and Girls Highschool Roleplay","desc":"","path":"/game/123997758440605-boys-and-girls-highschool-roleplay","slug":"123997758440605-boys-and-girls-highschool-roleplay","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/753285afead12424ec8ee07cacf343e79dc611ba80c1952c6151f12cf9d8c54e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1f8ecae1f3d054ef39d02d3ae9f257b8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-21T13:59:26.577Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":125553580825682,"name":"Swing Obby for Poppy Playtime 5!","desc":"","path":"/game/125553580825682-swing-obby-for-poppy-playtime-5","slug":"125553580825682-swing-obby-for-poppy-playtime-5","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/11ed541bb05ae9914b2cce016abf69a9fd7c9abc5b